abstract: "Claim-bounded repository package for Socio-Traffic Thermodynamics, integrating the original reduced stochastic ring-road surrogate with a risk-budgeted information-release audit sequence in finite-capacity toy traffic networks. The package does not claim real-world traffic prediction, traffic-policy validation, deployment readiness, or a universal congestion solution. License terms are given in the root LICENSE files."
